# for direnv (https://direnv.net/)
# create a .envrc symlink to this file or copy its contents to .envrc
# then run `direnv allow` to enable

# the python environment is built from these, watched before `use flake` so
# nix-direnv rebuilds its cached shell when they change
watch_file uv.lock pyproject.toml
use flake
dotenv_if_exists
